    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5002_T02",
      [
        "And it's taken Chloe captive. We must do something, Marinette!",
        "And it's taken Chloe captive. We must do something, Marinette!",
        "Et elle a capturé Chloé. On doit faire quelque chose, Marinette !",
