      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5004_T03",
      [
        "I guess I should say... thank you? Anyway, when were you going to let me in on that top secret plan you've been scheming?",
        "I guess I should say... thank you? Anyway, when were you going to let me in on that top secret plan you've been scheming?",
        "Alors je devrais... vous remercier ? Quand comptiez-vous m'expliquer ce plan secret que vous avez concocté ?",
        "",
        "Ich schätze, ich sollte dir danken? Und wann hättest du mich in den supergeheimen Plan, den du geschmiedet hast, eingeweiht?",
        "Supongo que debería... ¿agradecértelo? De todas formas, ¿cuándo pensabas revelarme el plan secreto que has estado pergeñando?",
        "",
        "Dovrei dirti... grazie? Comunque, quando mi avresti inclusa in quel piano top secret che stavi tramando?",
        "Ik zal maar zeggen... dank je wel? Maar goed, wanneer ga je me vertellen over dat topgeheime plan van je?",
