    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5004_T04",
      [
        "I admit I've been working alone. My idea was to create the ultimate sentimonster.",
        "I admit I've been working alone. My idea was to create the ultimate sentimonster.",
        "J'admets avoir travaillé seule sur ce projet. Je voulais donner naissance au sentimonstre ultime.",
        "",
        "Ich gebe zu, dass ich alleine gearbeitet habe. Meine Idee war es, das ultimative Sentimonster zu schaffen.",
        "Reconozco que he trabajado sola. Mi idea era engendrar el sentimonstruo definitivo.",
        "",
        "Confesso di aver agito da sola. La mia idea era di dar vita al sentimostro più potente di sempre.",
        "Ik geef toe dat ik er alleen aan heb gewerkt. Mijn idee was om het ultieme sentimonster te creëren.",
        "",
