      [
        "Is that so? And what in the world could the ultimate sentimonster manifest from?",
        "Is that so? And what in the world could the ultimate sentimonster manifest from?",
        "Vraiment ? Et à partir de quoi s'est-il donc manifesté, ce sentimonstre ultime ?",
