    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5004_T09",
      [
        "I needed you to ignite the spark without being aware of my plan. Otherwise, it never would have worked.",
        "I needed you to ignite the spark without being aware of my plan. Otherwise, it never would have worked.",
        "Il fallait que vous allumiez cette flamme sans que vous ne soyez au courant de mon plan. Sinon, il n'aurait jamais marché.",
