      [
        "It is strongly advised that we all stay in our homes until this situation is dealt with.",
        "It is strongly advised that we all stay in our homes until this situation is dealt with.",
        "Il est fortement recommandé de rester chez soi jusqu'à ce que la situation soit réglée.",
