      "TXT_DIALOG_CUTSCENE_27_16",
      [
        "Chloe is safe. How heroic of you to worry about her in spite of everything she's done to you. Heroic... but pointless.",
        "Chloe is safe. How heroic of you to worry about her in spite of everything she's done to you. Heroic... but pointless.",
        "Chloé va bien. Quel héroïsme de votre part, de vous inquiéter pour elle malgré tout ce qu'elle vous a fait subir. Un héroïsme bien inutile.",
