    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_CUTSCENE_28_22",
      [
        "You're right, Ladybug. What's the point of it all? There's been too much fighting. And too many people have suffered because of this conflict.",
        "You're right, Ladybug. What's the point of it all? There's been too much fighting. And too many people have suffered because of this conflict.",
        "Tu as raison, Ladybug. A quoi bon tout cela ? Nous nous sommes livrés trop de combats. Et trop de gens ont souffert à cause de ce conflit.",
        "",
        "Du hast Recht, Ladybug. Was ist der Sinn von alldem? Es gab zu viele Kämpfe. Und zu viele Menschen mussten wegen dieses Konflikts leiden.",
        "Tienes razón, Ladybug. ¿Qué sentido tiene? Hemos luchado demasiado. Y demasiada gente ha sufrido por este conflicto.",
        "",
        "Hai ragione, Ladybug. Che senso ha tutto questo? Abbiamo combattuto abbastanza. In tanti stanno soffrendo a causa di questo conflitto.",
        "Je hebt gelijk, Ladybug. Wat heeft het voor zin? Er is al te veel gevochten. Er zijn te veel mensen die hebben geleden onder dit conflict.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_CUTSCENE_28_23",
      [
        "You have the opportunity to make it stop, Ladybug. Everything could end tonight.",
        "You have the opportunity to make it stop, Ladybug. Everything could end tonight.",
        "Tu as l'occasion de mettre fin à cette guerre, Ladybug. Tout pourrait prendre fin ce soir.",
        "",
        "Du hast jetzt die Gelegenheit, es enden zu lassen, Ladybug. All das könnte heute Nacht enden.",
        "Tienes la oportunidad de parar todo esto, Ladybug. Todo podría acabar esta noche.",
        "",
        "Hai l'opportunità di fermarlo, Ladybug. Potrebbe finire tutto quanto questa sera.",
        "Jij kan zorgen dat het allemaal ophoudt, Ladybug. Alles kan vanavond voorbij zijn.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_CUTSCENE_28_24",
      [
        "Now, give me your Miraculous. Let me take that burden off of you.",
        "Now, give me your Miraculous. Let me take that burden off of you.",
        "Allez, donne-moi ton Miraculous. Laisse-moi te débarrasser de ce fardeau.",
        "",
        "Gib mir jetzt dein Miraculous. Lass mich dir die Last von den Schultern nehmen.",
        "Venga, dadme vuestros prodigios. Dejad que os libre de esa carga.",
        "",
        "Ora, datemi il vostro Miraculous. Lasciate che vi tolga questo peso.",
        "Geef mij maar je Miraculous. Laat mij deze last van je schouders halen.",
