    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP4_4007_T02",
      [
        "Ok, now... just to sum things up. Kagami's copycat was seen near a big white estate.",
        "Ok, now... just to sum things up. Kagami's copycat was seen near a big white estate.",
        "Bon... résumons. Le sosie de Kagami a été aperçu près d'une grande maison blanche.",
        "",
        "Okay, jetzt ... als Zusammenfassung. Kagamis Doppelgängerin wurde in der Nähe eines großen, weißen Hauses gesehen.",
        "De acuerdo..., recapitulemos. Han visto a la copiona de Kagami en los alrededores de una gran mansión blanca.",
        "",
        "Ok, dunque... ricapitolando... La sosia di Katami è stata avvistata vicino a una grande casa bianca.",
        "Oké, nou... even in het kort. Kagami's dubbelganger werd gespot bij een groot wit landgoed.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP4_4007_T03",
      [
        "This must be Adrien's house. Also, she was seen walking past the Place du Châtelet.",
        "This must be Adrien's house. Also, she was seen walking past the Place du Châtelet.",
        "Ce doit être celle d'Adrien. Elle a été aussi vue en train de déambuler place du Châtelet.",
        "",
        "Das muss Adriens Haus sein. Außerdem ist sie am Place du Châtelet vorbeigegangen.",
        "Debe de ser la casa de Adrien. También la han visto por la Place du Châtelet.",
        "",
        "Dev'essere la casa di Adrien. Inoltre, è stata vista superare Piazza du Châtelet.",
        "Dit is vast het huis van Adrien. Ze is ook gezien bij het Place du Châtelet.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP4_4007_T04",
      [
        "I get it! She's heading for the Place de la Concorde!",
        "I get it! She's heading for the Place de la Concorde!",
        "J'ai compris ! Elle se dirige vers la place de la Concorde !",
        "",
        "Ich habs! Sie geht zum Place de la Concorde!",
        "¡Ya lo sé! ¡Se dirige a la plaza de la Concordia!",
        "",
        "Ci sono! Si dirige verso Piazza della Concordia!",
        "Ik snap het! Ze is op weg naar het Place de la Concorde!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP4_4007_T05",
      [
        "The odds are good that we can find her there. Let's hurry up, Marinette!",
        "The odds are good that we can find her there. Let's hurry up, Marinette!",
        "On a de bonnes chances de l'y retrouver. Dépêchons-nous, Marinette !",
        "",
        "Die Chancen stehen gut, dass wir sie dort finden. Beeilen wir uns, Marinette!",
        "Tenemos buenas posibilidades de encontrarla allí. ¡Démonos prisa, Marinette!",
        "",
        "Ci sono buone probabilità di trovarla lì. Sbrighiamoci, Marinette!",
        "De kans is groot dat we haar daar vinden. Opschieten, Marinette!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5006_T01",
      [
        "Well done, Marinette! You scored us a clue!",
        "Well done, Marinette! You scored us a clue!",
        "Bravo, Marinette ! Tu as déniché un indice !",
        "",
        "Gut gemacht, Marinette! Du hast einen Hinweis gefunden!",
        "¡Bien hecho, Marinette! ¡Has obtenido una pista!",
        "",
        "Ottimo lavoro, Marinette! Hai trovato un indizio!",
        "Goed gedaan, Marinette. Je hebt een aanwijzing gevonden.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5006_T02",
      [
        "That's right! Finding more of these and we can clue in on the caterpillar. Let's go!",
        "That's right! Finding more of these and we can clue in on the caterpillar. Let's go!",
        "C'est ça ! Si on en trouve d'autres, on se rapprochera de la chenille. En avant !",
        "",
        "Richtig! Wir müssen nur mehr davon finden, um die Raupe aufzuspüren. Los gehts!",
        "¡Así es! Si encontramos más como esta, podremos averiguar el paradero de la oruga. ¡Vamos!",
        "",
        "Esatto! Trovane altri così potremo scovare il bruco. Andiamo!",
        "Klopt! Als we er meer vinden, hebben we genoeg informatie om de rups te vinden. Kom op.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5007_T01",
      [
        "And that makes two of them. The odds are good that the caterpillar has gone that way!",
        "And that makes two of them. The odds are good that the caterpillar has gone that way!",
        "Ça en fait deux. Il est probable que la chenille soit passée par là !",
        "",
        "Und das macht zwei. Die Chancen stehen gut, dass die Raupe da lang gegangen ist!",
        "Con esa van dos. ¡Es bastante probable que la oruga haya ido en esa dirección!",
        "",
        "E sono due. Ci sono buone probabilità che il bruco sia andato da quella parte!",
        "En dat zijn er twee. De kans is groot dat de rups die kant op is gegaan.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5007_T02",
      [
        "Let's keep up the good work, Marinette!",
        "Let's keep up the good work, Marinette!",
        "Continue comme ça, Marinette !",
        "",
        "Mach weiter so, Marinette!",
        "¡Sigue así de bien, Marinette!",
        "",
        "Continuiamo così, Marinette!",
        "Ga zo door, Marinette!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP5_5008_T01",
      [
        "One... two... three! We're getting close, Tikki. ",
        "One... two... three! We're getting close, Tikki. ",
        "Un... deux... trois ! On se rapproche du but, Tikki. ",
        "",
        "Eins ... Zwei ... Drei! Wir sind nah dran, Tikki. ",
        "Una..., dos... ¡Tres! Ya estamos cerca, Tikki. ",
        "",
        "Uno... due... tre! Ci siamo quasi, Tikki. ",
        "Eén... twee... drie. We komen in de buurt, Tikki. ",
