      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP1_1006_T07",
      [
        "Anyway. Let's just say you want to get him something he will never forget. What is your plan?",
        "Anyway. Let's just say you want to get him something he will never forget. What is your plan?",
        "Bref. Admettons que tu veuilles lui offrir quelque chose d'inoubliable. Quel serait ton plan ?",
        "",
        "Na ja. Sagen wir mal, du willst ihm etwas schenken, dass er nie vergessen wird. Was ist dein Plan?",
        "A ver. Digamos que quieres regalarle algo que nunca vaya a olvidar. ¿Cuál es tu plan?",
        "",
        "Comunque... Diciamo che vuoi fargli qualcosa che non dimenticherà mai. Cos'hai in mente?",
        "Maar goed. Laten we zeggen dat je hem iets onvergetelijks wil geven. Wat ben je van plan?",
