    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP1_1006_T08",
      [
        "I'll need the help of all my friends.",
        "I'll need the help of all my friends.",
        "Je vais avoir besoin de tous mes amis.",
        "",
        "Ich brauche die Hilfe aller meiner Freunde.",
        "Necesitaré la ayuda de todos mis amigos.",
        "",
        "Avrà bisogno di tutti i miei amici.",
        "Al mijn vrienden zullen me moeten helpen.",
        "",
