    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP1_1101_T03",
      [
        "It will remain blocked until the robots from the "Operation Clean Paris" are done doing their work. Mayor's orders, sorry.",
        "It will remain blocked until the robots from the "Operation Clean Paris" are done doing their work. Mayor's orders, sorry.",
        "Elle le restera tant que les robots de « l'opération Nettoyer Paris » n'auront pas terminé leur travail. Ordre du maire, désolé.",
        "",
