    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP7_7104_T01",
      [
        "I was furious at Chloé for messing with my identity, but I've decided not to give in to anger.",
        "I was furious at Chloé for messing with my identity, but I've decided not to give in to anger.",
        "J'en voulais à Chloé d'avoir usurpé mon identité, mais j'ai décidé de ne pas céder à la colère.",
