    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP7_8109_T02",
      [
        "Hard to say. I wasn't in the mood for anything actually. I felt pretty numb... and tired.",
        "Hard to say. I wasn't in the mood for anything actually. I felt pretty numb... and tired.",
        "Je ne saurais pas dire... J'étais d'humeur à rien, en fait. J'étais comme perdue... et fatiguée.",
        "",
        "Schwer zu sagen. Ich war für nichts so richtig in Stimmung. Ich fühlte mich ganz taub ... und müde.",
        "No sé decirte. No tenía ganas de nada. Me sentía desmotivada... y cansada.",
        "",
        "È una domanda difficile. A dire il vero, non mi andava di fare niente. Provavo solo una sensazione di stordimento... e stanchezza.",
        "Moeilijk te zeggen. Ik had echt nergens zin in. Ik voelde me heel verdoofd en moe.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_M_EP7_8109_T03",
      [
        "Same here. Still, my instincts told me I needed to think of something that made me feel better.",
        "Same here. Still, my instincts told me I needed to think of something that made me feel better.",
        "Moi aussi. Et pourtant, mon coeur me disait que j'avais besoin de penser à autre chose pour me sentir mieux.",
        "",
        "Ich auch. Und doch sagte mein Instinkt mir, dass ich an etwas denken sollte, das mich aufheitert.",
        "Yo igual, pero mi subconsciente me dijo que debía pensar en algo que me hiciera sentir mejor.",
        "",
        "Anch'io. Però l'istinto mi ha detto che dovevo pensare a qualcosa che mi facesse stare meglio.",
        "Ik ook. Maar mijn instinct zei dat ik aan iets moest denken om me beter te doen voelen.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
