      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_03",
      [
        "My sentimonster will reduce you to a smouldering pile of ash.",
        "My sentimonster will reduce you to a smouldering pile of ash.",
        "Mon sentimonstre va vous réduire en un tas de cendres fumantes.",
        "",
        "Wenn mein Sentimonster mit euch fertig ist, ist von euch nur noch ein Häufchen Asche übrig.",
        "Mi sentimonstruo os reducirá a un montoncito de ceniza humeante.",
        "",
        "Il mio sentimostro vi ridurrà in un mucchietto fumante di cenere.",
        "Mijn sentimonster maakt een hoopje as van jullie.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_04",
      [
        "Careful, you two. My sentimonster likes to bite.",
        "Careful, you two. My sentimonster likes to bite.",
        "Attention, vous deux. Mon sentimonstre aime bien mordre.",
        "",
        "Vorsicht, ihr beiden. Mein Sentimonster beißt.",
        "Cuidado, a mi sentimonstruo le gusta morder.",
        "",
        "Fate attenzione, voi due. Al mio sentimostro piace mordere.",
        "Voorzichtig, jullie twee. Mijn sentimonster bijt graag.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_05",
      [
        "Oh, now you've made it angry.",
        "Oh, now you've made it angry.",
        "Oh, vous l'avez mis en colère.",
        "",
        "Oh, jetzt habt ihr es verärgert.",
        "Oh, ahora me lo habéis cabreado.",
        "",
        "Ora l'avete fatto arrabbiare.",
        "Oh, nu heb je het boos gemaakt.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_06",
      [
        "No! My sentimonster!",
        "No! My sentimonster!",
        "Non ! Mon sentimonstre !",
        "",
        "Nein! Mein Sentimonster!",
        "¡No! ¡Mi sentimonstruo!",
        "",
        "No! Il mio sentimostro!",
        "Nee! Mijn sentimonster!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_07",
      [
        "You'll pay for harming my precious little caterpillar!",
        "You'll pay for harming my precious little caterpillar!",
        "Vous paierez pour avoir fait du mal à ma chenille adorée !",
        "",
        "Ihr werdet dafür bezahlen, dass ihr meine liebe kleine Raupe verletzt habt!",
        "¡Pagaréis por haberle hecho daño a mi oruguita!",
        "",
        "La pagherete per aver fatto del male al mio prezioso bruco!",
        "Jullie zullen spijt krijgen dat jullie mijn lieve kleine rupsje pijn hebben gedaan!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_08",
      [
        "Don't you think it'd be wiser to give me your Miraculous?",
        "Don't you think it'd be wiser to give me your Miraculous?",
        "Vous ne croyez pas qu'il serait plus sage de me donner vos Miraculous ?",
        "",
        "Denkt ihr nicht, es wäre klüger, mir eure Miraculous zu geben?",
        "¿No os parece más sensato darme vuestros prodigios?",
        "",
        "Non credete che sarebbe più saggio darmi i vostri Miraculous?",
        "Vinden jullie het niet verstandiger om mij gewoon jullie Miraculous te geven?",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
      ],
    ],
    [
      "TXT_DIALOG_BARK_MYU_09",
      [
        "You're no match against my caterpillar. Just give me your Miraculous!",
        "You're no match against my caterpillar. Just give me your Miraculous!",
        "Vous n'avez aucune chance contre ma chenille. Donnez-moi vos Miraculous !",
        "",
        "Ihr seid keine Gegner für meine Raupe. Gebt mir einfach eure Miraculous!",
        "No sois rival para mi oruga. ¡Dadme vuestros prodigios y punto!",
        "",
        "Non siete all'altezza del mio bruco. Datemi i vostri Miraculous!",
        "Jullie maken geen kans tegen mijn rups. Geef me gewoon jullie Miraculous!",
        "",
        "",
        "",
