    [
      "TXT_BIO_3_SENTENCE",
      [
        ""All that is necessary for the triumph of evil is that good people do nothing."",
        ""All that is necessary for the triumph of evil is that good people do nothing."",
        "« Pour que les méchants triomphent, il suffit que les gentils ne fassent rien. »",
        "",
        "„Alles, was das Böse braucht, um zu triumphieren, sind gute Menschen, die untätig bleiben."",
        ""Lo único necesario para que el mal triunfe es que la gente buena no haga nada".",
        "",
        ""Perché il male trionfi è sufficiente che la gente virtuosa non faccia nulla."",
        ""Het enige wat nodig is om het kwaad te laten overwinnen is dat goede mensen niets doen."",
