      [
        "Tom Dupain is a devoted baker, who runs his own bakery shop with his beloved wife Sabine. Having learned baking from his own father he means to always support his daughter Marinette in everything she does.",
        "Tom Dupain is a devoted baker, who runs his own bakery shop with his beloved wife Sabine. Having learned baking from his own father he means to always support his daughter Marinette in everything she does.",
        "Passionné par son métier, Tom Dupain tient une boulangerie avec Sabine, son épouse bien-aimée. Ayant appris les ficelles du métier auprès de son père, il essaie de toujours soutenir sa fille Marinette dans tout ce qu'elle entreprend.",
        "",
